Credit Risk This plan is underwritten by YF Life Insurance International Ltd. The insurance benefits are held solely responsible by the company and subject to its credit risk.
Key Exclusions If the Insured commits suicide, whether sane or insane, within one year from the Policy Date, our total liability shall be limited to the aggregate of the Account Value on the date of death of the Insured and the Cost of Insurance deducted (without any interest).
